🛒 E-Commerce Sales Analyzer

📌 About the Project

E-Commerce Sales Analyzer is an intermediate-level Python project that analyzes product sales, revenue, and monthly sales using SQL and NumPy. It stores product and order information in a database and provides useful sales insights through a simple menu-driven program.

🚀 Features

- View all available products
- Calculate total sales revenue
- Generate product-wise sales reports
- Identify the best-selling product
- Analyze monthly sales revenue
- Calculate total and average units sold
- Calculate average monthly revenue

🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python – Program logic and menu system
- SQL – Database queries and sales analysis
- SQLite – Stores product and order data
- NumPy – Numerical calculations

