⚙️ Installation and Setup

Step 1: Install Python on your computer.

Step 2: Install NumPy using the terminal:

pip install numpy

Step 3: Run the program:

python ecommerce_analyzer.py

Step 4: Choose an option from the menu to analyze sales data.

